status GREEN -- capability_lattice witness green on metal this lap, 59 legs, faults=0, control_verdict=ok, and the live scan agrees with every figure the card publishes. The hot roster pass read 270 green, 3 red, 2 gated at %5; all three reds share one root, the card's mistyped Git nib, and all three are closed on metal -- nib_honesty and remember_git_nib re-run GREEN through the runner rather than by hand, and standing_equipment GREEN behind them
recommend keep-going -- the next lap opens on moonshot rows 5, 8 and 12, the three still carrying no reading at all, and carries one named instrument it could build first: a meter holding a document's self-claimed grade to what qa_report_card answers, which this lap proved is a promise nothing reads
